{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"0d0fe3d3-14f4-4ac4-bcf4-ecdd6d9f307f","type":"text","text":"## 2. CONTACT DISCOVERY\n\nCreate / identify the company in CRM and use the **Apollo API** to find relevant contacts.\n\nFind decision-makers such as Head of Data, Director of Analytics, CIO / technology leaders, etc.\n\nRetrieve available email, phone, and profile information.","x":1400,"y":320,"width":1100,"height":250,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"d1e68037-29f2-4512-9ce5-08ba2bd1bd01","type":"text","text":"## YES — QUALIFIED\n\nMove the prospect into the active **Lead Flow**.\n\n**Outreach → Follow-up → Response → Meeting → Opportunity**","x":4300,"y":160,"width":1150,"height":260,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"8d677dfa-8ed5-4550-8bfa-40dae4061951","type":"text","text":"## NO — NOT QUALIFIED\n\nDo not start active outreach.\n\nStore the record with the qualification result, reason, source/signal, company details, and contact details.\n\nKeep it available for future review.","x":4300,"y":570,"width":1150,"height":280,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"e0bd84f6-b6e6-494f-9860-0e63c5c551d2","type":"text","text":"## ACTIVE LEAD FLOW\n\n**1. Outreach**\nPersonalised communication\n\n↓\n\n**2. Follow-up**\nAutomated sequence + human control\n\n↓\n\n**3. Engagement**\nResponse / interest detected\n\n↓\n\n**4. Meeting**\nSchedule and prepare the right internal people\n\n↓\n\n**5. Opportunity**","x":5900,"y":0,"width":1400,"height":550,"color":"7"},
		{"id":"36c0dd61-82c4-4a71-9e8d-29f01ab03b18","type":"text","text":"## CRM DATABASE\n\nBoth qualified and unqualified prospects are retained.\n\n**Qualified → Active Lead Flow**\n\n**Not Qualified → Stored / Inactive**\n\nA record can be re-qualified later.","x":5900,"y":680,"width":1400,"height":270,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"1a3ecb18-f25f-4cc2-a246-70ca780fa8ab","type":"text","text":"## HUMAN OVERRIDE\n\nAutomation supports the team, but people can still correct signals, override qualification, edit/approve outreach, pause follow-ups, or re-qualify an older prospect.","x":0,"y":1050,"width":1500,"height":250,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"770d9de4-3fbf-4471-b9ad-246c98dd0420","type":"text","text":"## EXISTING MANUAL LEADS\n\nA prospect does not have to start from signal discovery.\n\nEvent / referral / inbound / business card / manually added lead\n\n→ enters the same **qualification and Lead Flow** process.","x":1750,"y":1050,"width":1500,"height":250,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"1b0141ac-70eb-455c-bf7d-aebb7d2c854c","type":"text","text":"## CORE DESIGN PRINCIPLE\n\n**Apollo = Find the people**\n\n**AI / ICP = Decide whether the prospect fits**\n\n**CRM = Manage the lifecycle**\n\n**Lead Flow = Engage and convert qualified prospects**","x":3500,"y":1050,"width":1800,"height":250,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"ad1b962a-771d-4eb3-b146-3b183b78c270","type":"text","text":"# KRUISE CRM — Signal to Lead Flow\n\nSimple business flow: **Signal → Contact Discovery → ICP Qualification → Lead Flow or Store**","x":0,"y":-40,"width":1200,"height":120},
		{"id":"4c653917-5dd2-4b04-bffc-f588bf9db1b9","type":"text","text":"## 1. FIND SIGNAL\n\nFind a potential business need manually.\n\nSources: LinkedIn, job portals, company activity/news, referrals, or any credible source.\n\nExample: **ABB is hiring a Head of Data & AI.**","x":-80,"y":320,"width":1100,"height":250,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"8f9052fc-97b0-4e99-9a49-9180372a44b5","type":"text","text":"## 3. AI / ICP QUALIFICATION\n\nUse the signal + company context + contact context to determine whether the prospect fits the Ideal Customer Profile.\n\nCheck industry, company profile, Data & AI need, technology fit, relevant decision-maker, and whether Kruise can support the requirement.","x":2800,"y":350,"width":1150,"height":220,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"87725e6d5452ec59","x":2945,"y":1520,"width":860,"height":500,"type":"text","text":"## Required apollo api's\n\n1. Signal / Company Research\n\t1. `GET /organizations/enrich` - Get company details from the signal\n\t2. `POST /news_articles/search` (not compulsory) - Optional company/news signals\n2. Contact discovery\n\t1. `POST /mixed_people/api_search` - Find relevant decision-makers\n\t2. `GET /people/{id}` - Get complete person information\n3. ICP Qualification\n\t1. `GET /organizations/{id}` - Get full company context\n\t2. `GET /people/{id}` - Get full contact context\n"},
		{"id":"5f92c200c8c9bfb4","x":3985,"y":1640,"width":1149,"height":500,"type":"text","text":"|#|API|Free-plan access explicitly documented?|Credit usage|What that means for your Free plan|\n|---|---|---|--:|---|\n|1|`GET /organizations/enrich`|**Yes**|**1 credit / organization**|✅ Available; uses your free credits|\n|2|`POST /news_articles/search`|**Not explicitly stated on endpoint page**|**1 credit / page**|⚠️ I cannot conclusively say from the endpoint page alone that it is Free-plan accessible|\n|3|`POST /mixed_people/api_search`|**Yes**|**0 credits**|✅ Available; does not consume credits|\n|4|`GET /people/{id}`|**Yes**|**1 credit / person**|✅ Available; uses your free credits|\n|5|`GET /organizations/{id}`|**Yes, effectively**|**1 credit / company**|✅ Available; uses your free credits|\n|6|`GET /people/{id}`|**Yes**|**1 credit / person**|✅ Available; uses your free credits|\n"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"025211b5-31e3-4f4d-b96d-8fb5d8d510f1","endArrow":"arrow","fromNode":"4c653917-5dd2-4b04-bffc-f588bf9db1b9","fromSide":"right","toNode":"0d0fe3d3-14f4-4ac4-bcf4-ecdd6d9f307f","toSide":"left","label":"signal + company"},
